Turning back to our YANI, why don't add spell efficiency instead? The
more you cast the spell, the more the spell becomes powerful. This
differs from spells schools, because if you zap 250 times Knock, not
only you improve Matter school (and then all the others spells in that
school), but you improve that particular spell too. Obviously, it's
harder to improve spell efficiency in NH than in ADOM because ADOM
hasn't spell schools. Spell efficiency in NH may reduce the power
needed to cast, the time to re-learn that particular spell and
increase  the range, the damage and the HP healed (where applicable).

